event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_03575ddf1aba2605016adb6340f1b887d2abf57594030588d1","output_index":0,"sequence_number":89,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering local times and weather**\n\nI need to find out the current local times, focusing just on the times and not dates. I want to ensure that we account for the time difference: for instance, when it’s 17:28 in London, it’s 12:28 in New York. I also want to include the weather to provide full context. That way, anyone who reads this gets not just the time but also a sense of the current conditions!"}

